Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":4,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":75,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1914777,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":287331,"Name":"Shaquana325","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287331.jpg?_r=1468197550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1468184872,"LastPoster":{"Id":287113,"Name":"DreamArtPhotography","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287113.jpg?_r=1468269302","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":true},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1914777,"PostDate":1468184872,"PostContent":"Hello Everyone! \u00a0 I am newly engaged and my fianc\u00e9 and I are 100% sure we want to have a destinat...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"edwards025@aol.com","IpAddress":"71.187.101.38","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1468182716,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287331.jpg?_r=1468197550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Shaquana325","Id":287331,"Name":"Shaquana325","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.187.101.38","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80184,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3f2292125b05a60b695b0e151f9c8dad","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello Everyone!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am newly engaged and my fianc\u00e9 and I are 100% sure we want to have a destination wedding simply because between the two of us, we have way too many family and friends and wouldn&#039;t be able to afford it in the states. We&#039;ve visited a few resorts such as Rivera Maya Mexico, Secret St. James in Montego Bay Jamaica and recently, Dreams in Bahamas. We absolutely fell in love with Jamaica and would love for our wedding to be there BUT the resort we stayed on was ADULTS ONLY resort. Our wedding party will definitely contain children being as though we have a 9 year old son. So I have quite a few questions for those who have already experienced the beginning stages:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;1. Which resort in Montego Bay, Jamaica best fits the needs of both adults and children or any resort in Jamaica?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;2. What&#039;s in the fine print that no one tells you until you see the bill at the end of it all?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;3. What are the little extras we should bring? Such as flowers, decorations, lanterns or any DIY&#039;s?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;4. Has anyone ever used a travel agency for their guest? if so was it worth it and which agency?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;5. Any extra add ons that you paid for at the resort was it worth it? and if so what were they?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Also, any other tips would be greatly appreciated. We are fairly new and clueless when it comes to planning so any and all information would help.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have not contacted a resort yet, but plan on it this week to see who offers the best wedding package deal.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks so much!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914777,"PostDate":1468184872,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello Everyone!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am newly engaged and my fianc\u00e9 and I are 100% sure we want to have a destination wedding simply because between the two of us, we have way too many family and friends and wouldn't be able to afford it in the states. We've visited a few resorts such as Rivera Maya Mexico, Secret St. James in Montego Bay Jamaica and recently, Dreams in Bahamas. We absolutely fell in love with Jamaica and would love for our wedding to be there BUT the resort we stayed on was ADULTS ONLY resort. Our wedding party will definitely contain children being as though we have a 9 year old son. So I have quite a few questions for those who have already experienced the beginning stages:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>1. Which resort in Montego Bay, Jamaica best fits the needs of both adults and children or any resort in Jamaica?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>2. What's in the fine print that no one tells you until you see the bill at the end of it all?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>3. What are the little extras we should bring? Such as flowers, decorations, lanterns or any DIY's?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>4. Has anyone ever used a travel agency for their guest? if so was it worth it and which agency?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>5. Any extra add ons that you paid for at the resort was it worth it? and if so what were they?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Also, any other tips would be greatly appreciated. We are fairly new and clueless when it comes to planning so any and all information would help.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have not contacted a resort yet, but plan on it this week to see who offers the best wedding package deal.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks so much!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"edwards025@aol.com","IpAddress":"71.187.101.38","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1468182716,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287331.jpg?_r=1468197550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Shaquana325","Id":287331,"Name":"Shaquana325","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.136.25.73","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80184,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d7523b2cf7d271132e73ea5fde7c433d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Good morning @[member=\"Shaquana325\"] and welcome to the wonderful BestDestinationWedding community.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;There are a tonne of amazing members and resources at your disposal. The best tip we can suggest, is what you&#039;re doing right now. Doing research and planning ahead is the best way to ensure your perfect destination wedding.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We recently stayed at the Grand Bahia Runaway Bay which is just outside of Montego Bay Jamaica. It was such a beautiful resort. The hotel itself was beautiful and well maintained, the staff were super friendly and helpful. Overall we had an absolutely amazing time there. If you want to see photos of the grounds check out the following gallery.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:albums:18226]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Cheers!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914785,"PostDate":1468232677,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Good morning @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287331\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/287331-shaquana325\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Shaquana325<\/span><\/a> and welcome to the wonderful BestDestinationWedding community.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>There are a tonne of amazing members and resources at your disposal. The best tip we can suggest, is what you're doing right now. Doing research and planning ahead is the best way to ensure your perfect destination wedding.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We recently stayed at the Grand Bahia Runaway Bay which is just outside of Montego Bay Jamaica. It was such a beautiful resort. The hotel itself was beautiful and well maintained, the staff were super friendly and helpful. Overall we had an absolutely amazing time there. If you want to see photos of the grounds check out the following gallery.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><div class='_sharedMediaBbcode'>\n\t<div class='bbcode_mediaWrap clearfix'>\n\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/album\/18226-grand-bahia-jamaica\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18226\/tn_gallery_287055_18226_1389495.jpg' class='sharedmedia_screenshot cover_img_75' title='Grand Bahia Jamaica 016'  width='75' height='75'  alt='Grand Bahia Jamaica 016' id='tn_image_view_84171_cover' \/><\/a>\n\t\t<div class='details'>\n\t\t\t<h5><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/album\/18226-grand-bahia-jamaica\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>Album: Grand Bahia Jamaica<\/a><\/h5>\n\t\t\t<div>32 images<\/div>\n\t\t\t<div>0 comments<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Cheers!<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1914785]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-287055-0-02990100-1468247072.jpg\" title=\"Meghan_Shawn_Teaser_22.jpg - Size: 66.46KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-287055-0-02990100-1468247072.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Meghan_Shawn_Teaser_22.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/05\/jasminandmattidomexicosignature.png\" alt=\"jasminandmattidomexicosignature.png\"><\/p>\n<p><strong>Website:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/'>http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Email:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:info@jasminandmatt.com'>info@jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Phone:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\">+52 984-114-3386<\/span><br><strong>Facebook:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/'>Jasmin & Matt Photography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Instagram:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/jasminandmattphotography\/'>@jasminandmattphotography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Pinterest:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/jasminandmatt'>Jasmin & Matt<\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/info\/testimonials\/'>Read our testimonials of appreciation from previous couples<\/a>\u00a0<3<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Rated 5 out of 5 stars on Facebook. <strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/reviews'>Check us out!<\/a><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"forward@jasminandmatt.com","IpAddress":"187.153.21.84","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1464781539,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287055.jpg?_r=1464796174","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JasminMattPhoto","Id":287055,"Name":"JasminMattPhoto","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.46.54","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80184,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Moments That Matter, Today, 11:27 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1468236461,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5298ecef41ff086914de43756ca4bd4d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the boards, and Congrats on your Jamaican wedding next November, Shaquana325!!! You&#039;re already off to a great start by joining here where there are so many resources to help with your planning questions!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;re based in the magnificent Mayan Riviera, so are most familiar with this area, however Jamaica sounds awesome too :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope you find everything you&#039;re looking for, and enjoy your wonderful journey ahead - cheers!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Moments That Matter Photography team :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_114a3920645c4b0d9b9b799f46c26cf5.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1204,h_803,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01\/e89d55_114a3920645c4b0d9b9b799f46c26cf5.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_114a3920645c4b0d9b9b799f46c26cf5.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_623e72e2483d4cdbac5f8d209d3c2cc7.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1204,h_803,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01\/e89d55_623e72e2483d4cdbac5f8d209d3c2cc7.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_623e72e2483d4cdbac5f8d209d3c2cc7.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914786,"PostDate":1468236322,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to the boards, and Congrats on your Jamaican wedding next November, Shaquana325!!! You're already off to a great start by joining here where there are so many resources to help with your planning questions!<\/p>\n<p>We're based in the magnificent Mayan Riviera, so are most familiar with this area, however Jamaica sounds awesome too <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>Hope you find everything you're looking for, and enjoy your wonderful journey ahead - cheers!!!<\/p>\n<p>Moments That Matter Photography team <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_114a3920645c4b0d9b9b799f46c26cf5.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1204,h_803,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01\/e89d55_114a3920645c4b0d9b9b799f46c26cf5.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_114a3920645c4b0d9b9b799f46c26cf5.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_623e72e2483d4cdbac5f8d209d3c2cc7.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1204,h_803,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01\/e89d55_623e72e2483d4cdbac5f8d209d3c2cc7.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_623e72e2483d4cdbac5f8d209d3c2cc7.\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i1378.photobucket.com\/albums\/ah106\/ContactIDoMexico\/MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\" alt=\"MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.149.202.99","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80184,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"750f0f79cba189c85e2f5bdd1178e6ea","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Shaquana325\"] Congrats! Montego Bay is amazing,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Please consider Moon Palace Jamaica Grande at ocho rios.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:albums:18203]&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914797,"PostDate":1468252219,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287331\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/287331-shaquana325\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Shaquana325<\/span><\/a> Congrats! Montego Bay is amazing,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Please consider Moon Palace Jamaica Grande at ocho rios.<\/p>\n<div><div class='_sharedMediaBbcode'>\n\t<div class='bbcode_mediaWrap clearfix'>\n\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/album\/18203-jamaica\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18203\/tn_gallery_287113_18203_1056790.jpg' class='sharedmedia_screenshot cover_img_75' title='jam2'  width='75' height='75'  alt='jam2' id='tn_image_view_83640_cover' \/><\/a>\n\t\t<div class='details'>\n\t\t\t<h5><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/album\/18203-jamaica\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>Album: Jamaica<\/a><\/h5>\n\t\t\t<div>15 images<\/div>\n\t\t\t<div>0 comments<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<br \/><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span>Saludos<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span><b>Virginia Hermosillo<\/b><\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Dream Art \u00a0Wedding Photography<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span><span>contact<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:vhermosillo@dreamartphotography.com'>@dreamartphotography.com<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span>Tel: +(52) 998 246-5657<\/span><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/weddings.dreamartphotography.com'>http:\/\/weddings.dreamartphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><img src=\"http:\/\/weddings.dreamartphotography.com\/images\/wedding-logo-moto.png\" alt=\"wedding-logo-moto.png\"><\/p>\n<p><span>\u00a0<\/span>","Email":"contact@dreamartphotography.com","IpAddress":"189.221.43.89","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1465480401,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287113.jpg?_r=1468269302","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"DreamArtPhotography","Id":287113,"Name":"DreamArtPhotography","IsOnline":true}}],"Id":"80184","Title":"Newly Engaged And Confused","LastPostDate":1468252219},"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},