Content":"We ordered fantastic personalized travel mugs from Discountmugs.com. They looked fabulous. Everyone loved them. Everyone was happy. &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/rolleyes.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Roll Eyes\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n Of course, we bought them so people could enjoy their beverages on the beach. So here&#039;s my WARNING!!!!\n \n &lt;font color=\"Blue\"&gt;The personalized part of the mug will rub off when they&#039;re in the sun. I don&#039;t know if it&#039;s the combo of sunscreen &amp;amp; direct sunlight or what, but those EXPENSIVE personalization rubbed right off!&lt;\/font&gt;\n \n If I did it all again, I would NOT have paid the extra couple $$s to get each personalized. I&#039;d definitely bring travel mugs - everybody loved them - but just plain ones that would&#039;ve saved us lots of $$$$.\n \n So there&#039;s my warning. Just buy the plain travel mugs!","Attachments":[],"Id":276286,"PostDate":1208866636,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We ordered fantastic personalized travel mugs from Discountmugs.com. They looked fabulous. Everyone loved them. Everyone was happy. <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/rolleyes.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Roll Eyes\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Of course, we bought them so people could enjoy their beverages on the beach. So here's my WARNING!!!!<br \/> <br \/> <font color=\"Blue\">The personalized part of the mug will rub off when they're in the sun. I don't know if it's the combo of sunscreen & direct sunlight or what, but those EXPENSIVE personalization rubbed right off!<\/font><br \/> <br \/> If I did it all again, I would NOT have paid the extra couple $$s to get each personalized. I'd definitely bring travel mugs - everybody loved them - but just plain ones that would've saved us lots of $$$$.<br \/> <br \/> So there's my warning. Just buy the plain travel mugs!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Married April 4, 2008 at the Riu Ocho Rios!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"hln321@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1174585620,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207275.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Heidi","Id":207275,"Name":"Heidi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":15069,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6dab5599f3f8cef180bc26a859d4cd21","RawContent":"Good to know!","Attachments":[],"Id":276288,"PostDate":1208866873,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Good to know!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Em