{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62835,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e65349104c9f5a0e2af5046996ccaa41","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Both are beautiful but I like #2.&amp;nbsp; However, like all the other ladies have said you may feel differently once it&#039;s on you.&amp;nbsp; Definitely go to a salon and try on those 2 styles (or all styles) and see which one flatters you more!&amp;nbsp; Good luck!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1579267,"PostDate":1328625362,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Both are beautiful but I like #2.\u00a0 However, like all the other ladies have said you may feel differently once it's on you.\u00a0 Definitely go to a salon and try on those 2 styles (or all styles) and see which one flatters you more!\u00a0 Good luck!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jaweis8@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1314025110,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-244254.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jamie5280","Id":244254,"Name":"Jamie5280","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62835,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c6d752a8093a5a171381a821a3b26024","RawContent":"I love number 2! If you have a good waist and some curves it will look amazing :-) [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]rasuei[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I will get married on 12th , November . I have found 2 dresses on the storeofdress website. But I don&#039;t know which dress is more beautiful? I wish you can give me some advices. \n \n Here are the links of the two dresses. \n dress#1 \n [url=\"http:\/\/shop.storeofdress.com\/product.php?productid=48602&amp;amp;cat=599&amp;amp;page=1\"]http:\/\/shop.storeofdress.com\/product.php?productid=48602&amp;amp;cat=599&amp;amp;page=1[\/url] \n dress#2 \n [url=\"http:\/\/shop.storeofdress.com\/product.php?productid=52619&amp;amp;cat=313&amp;amp;page=1\"]http:\/\/shop.storeofdress.com\/product.php?productid=52619&amp;amp;cat=313&amp;amp;page=1[\/url] \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1579268,"PostDate":1328625440,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> I love number 2! If you have a good waist and some curves it will look amazing :-)<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>rasuei<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I will get married on 12th , November . I have found 2 dresses on the storeofdress website. But I don't know which dress is more beautiful? I wish you can give me some advices.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here are the links of the two dresses.<\/p> <p> dress#1<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/shop.storeofdress.com\/product.php?productid=48602&cat=599&page=1' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/shop.storeofd...&cat=599&page=1<\/a><\/p> <p> dress#2<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/shop.storeofdress.com\/product.php?productid=52619&cat=313&page=1' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/shop.storeofd...&cat=313&page=1<\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vicky.harrow@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1328282072,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250935.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrs squash","Id":250935,"Name":"mrs squash","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62835,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fad3844d3a7bb9e9d175261c06b4dfd3","RawContent":"I like #2","Attachments":[],"Id":1592376,"PostDate":1331248599,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I like #2\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"realcdngirl@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1330442869,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-252057.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":147,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Realcdngirl","Id":252057,"Name":"Realcdngirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62835,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f44b946bb8922ef3860add92cd42fe67","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; # 2&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1592396,"PostDate":1331250371,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> # 2<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"salgado.jaz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"152.131.9.71","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1300033181,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237756.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jazzy","Id":237756,"Name":"Jazzy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62835,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"92e1f67674646786d3ef49a8853e459b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Def. love the 2nd one!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1592444,"PostDate":1331284920,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Def. love the 2nd one!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>46 booked and counting!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bellaangels@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1309473991,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241828.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"stella331","Id":241828,"Name":"stella331","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62835,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cdadea1992d77e988dbb0f4c708e1154","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I like number 2 best but I agree with all the grls on here. Make sure that you go to a bridal store and try on the two different styles. I had picked a dress online that I loved but when I tried it on I was not that happy with it. Instead I found a mermaid type dress that looked amazing on me.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1594377,"PostDate":1331670114,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I like number 2 best but I agree with all the grls on here. Make sure that you go to a bridal store and try on the two different styles. I had picked a dress online that I loved but when I tried it on I was not that happy with it. Instead I found a mermaid type dress that looked amazing on me.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Wedding booked for December 12, 2012 at the RIU Ocho Rio....cannot wait.....it will be the best day of our lives<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"k.imrie@live.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1283372980,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231967.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kristy28","Id":231967,"Name":"Kristy28","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62835,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"32828c4babbaa6ca7ff2cfbe755d457e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I like dress #1.. And thats a great deal!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1595925,"PostDate":1331912622,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I like dress #1.. And thats a great deal!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"britneyrasco@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1329416272,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-251499.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MissBubbles205","Id":251499,"Name":"MissBubbles205","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62835,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c5b924972dcf046401db6e87a274ce8d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; My vote goes to dress #2&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1595936,"PostDate":1331913795,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> My vote goes to dress #2<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tapurnell@msn.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1326159751,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":